'''Healer''' is a dungeon [[class]] that specializes in healing and support.

== Class Passives ==
*{{AN|Renew}}: Your healing abilities heal the target for 50% additional HP.
*{{AN|Healing Aura}}: Passively heals all living teammates within a 8 block radius for 0.5% {{stat|HP}} per second
*{{AN|Revive}}: Spawns a fairy that follows you and uses its energy to revive dead teammates, while no-one is dead, it will stick and provide support. Vanishes for 100 seconds after reviving a player.
*{{AN|Orbies}}: Enemies that you help kill have a 15% chance to drop an orb that anyone can pick up. The orb heals the player who picked it up and grants them a random buff.
**There are 3 types of orbs and each can be picked up by any teammate for quick heal for 30% of their maximum health, as well as a short {{stat|ad}}, {{stat|dmg}} or {{stat|def}} buff.
*{{AN|Soul Tether}}: Clicking on a teammate creates a tether connecting yourself to them. Tethered teammates received 0.5% of your maximum health as healing every second while they are within 30 blocks of you. Every 5 melee hits you deal while tethered will heal both players for 1% of the maximum health.
*{{AN|Overheal}}: Healing a player that is full health will convert the healing into an absorption shield up 20% to of their health.

== Dungeon Orb Abilities ==
*{{AN|Healing Circle}}: Launches a healing orb that creates a healing circle where it lands. The healing circle heals friendly players inside for 2% of their health every second. {{Cooldown|2}}
*{{AN|Wish}}: Heals everyone in your group to full health and grants them an {{statname | absorption}} shields for 20% of their max health. {{Cooldown|120}}

== Ghost Abilities ==

*{{AN|Healing Potion}}: Throw a potion which heals all teammates in a 10 block radius for 10% of their max health and +100 {{stat|hp}}
*{{AN|Revive}}: Revive yourself after 50 seconds.

== Leveling Rewards ==
{{/Skill UI}}

You can level up the healer class while playing as a healer or if you have a teammate that is Healer, you get some of its healer XP as a team bonus.

For every healer level up to level 50 you get:

*+ 1% Renew Healing
*+ 2 Ghost Healing Potion Healing 
*+ 1% Wish Shield Percent
*- 1s Revive Cooldown
*+ 0.4% Overheal Maximum Shield
*{{Stat|Vitality|+0.2}}
*{{Stat|Mending|+0.5}}

For every other healer level you get:

*+ 1% Ghost Healing Potion Healing

For every 5 healer levels you get:

*+ 0.1% Healing Aura Healing
*+ 0.5% Healing Circle Healing
*+ 0.5 Healing Circle Radius
*+ 1 Healing Circle Duration

At level 50 you get the following buffs:

* Abilites heal for +50% additional hp, for a total of +100%
* Healing Aura heals for +1% more, for a total of 2% of {{statname | health}}
* -50s revive cooldown, lowering the cooldown to 50s
* +50% Wish Shield, for a total of an {{statname | absorption}} shield 70% of their maximum health
* Ghost Healing Potion Heals for 100+ and +25% more, for a total of 200 {{statname | health}} and 35% of their max health
* Healing Circle heals for +5%, for a total of 7% of HP per second
* Overheal gives a shield for up to 40%
* {{Stat|Vitality|+20.2}}
* {{Stat|Mending|+25.5}}

== Milestones ==
{{Main|Class Milestones}}
Healer class can reach its milestones by healing players in the dungeon. Refer [[Class_Milestones#Catacombs|here]] for a table showcasing class milestones. 

== Trivia ==
*The Orbies perk resembles the set bonus of the Nebula Armor from Terraria<ref>[[terraria:Nebula_armor]]</ref>, which also causes orbs to drop and provides the same bonuses of health, defense and ability damage.
*Healer's ultimate might be a reference to Soraka's ultimate from '''League of Legends''' or a high-level mage spell in '''Dungeons & Dragons''' as it all function similarly and have the same name.
*The Soul Tether ability may be a reference to Io's Tether ability in Dota 2 as they share the concept of extra restoration within a certain distance.
